          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Thu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Řekne nejbližší nesplněný termín – zkoušku, zápočet, projekt nebo úkol – a kolik zbývá času." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tells you your next pending deadline – exam, credit test, project or assignment – and how much time is left."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Řekne, kdy a kde máš nejbližší hodinu podle rozvrhu ze STAGu." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tells you when and where your next class is, based on your STAG timetable."
          }
        }
      }
    },
